- Major screens must have URLs.
- Browser back/forward must work.
- Refreshing a deep page must reopen the same screen.
- Application-specific pages must carry `applicationId`.
- Inspection-specific pages must carry `inspectionId`.
- Document/parameter identities must appear in the URL when the record identity matters.
- Shareable workflow state belongs in route segments/search params, not hidden component state.
