src/lib/auth/permissions.ts
```

Production requirements later:

- server-validated session
- HttpOnly secure cookies where applicable
- role/desk/department/office permissions loaded from backend account mapping
- no role selection at login
- route-level authorization
- server-side authorization for every mutation
