### Recommended future API domains

```text
auth
users/officer-context
applications
workflow
documents
scrutiny
queries
inspections
decisions
dependencies
compliance
sla
grievances
regulatory
analytics
notifications
audit
```

Do not create fake endpoint contracts if backend specifications already exist elsewhere in the repository. Inspect and reuse them.

For future authenticated backend reads, explicitly classify caching. Officer/application/permission-sensitive reads should normally be request-time/non-shared (`cache: 'no-store'` where using `fetch`) until the backend/data team defines safe revalidation and cache-key semantics. Do not introduce `use cache` around sensitive personalized reads merely for performance.

