- make RAG output directly approve/reject, change applicability, unlock dependencies, or mutate application state
- copy the MIDC route tree to create MPCB/Fire/DISH/etc.
- delete M-screens that are difficult to route
- replace existing UI with a component-library dashboard theme
- replace real government assets with generic icons
- let service worker cache everything
- register the Department service worker with root scope `/`
- use `/login` as an unscoped Department login when the Department surface is standardized under `/department/`
- cache officer-specific Next.js data/pages with shared framework caches without a reviewed policy
- cache auth/session/CAPTCHA responses
- use stale-while-revalidate for official decision data without explicit approval
- enable experimental automatic offline mutation retry/replay for official actions without backend idempotency/audit design
- replay official POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE operations from background sync automatically
- use unconditional `skipWaiting()` + forced reload that can discard unsaved officer input
- use older `middleware.ts` alongside Next.js 16 `proxy.ts`
- generate initial SSR-visible CAPTCHA/random/time values differently on server and client
- store sensitive records in localStorage merely to support offline mode
- request notification permission immediately on first page load
- use `any` everywhere to make TypeScript compile
- suppress build errors instead of fixing them
- retain Figma Make Vite plugins in production Next.js config
- delete `src/imports/pasted_text`/Figma specification evidence before corresponding parity is verified
- configure `output: 'export'` for the production authenticated portal
- create a second React router inside Next.js
