# FINAL MIGRATION PRINCIPLE

**The purpose of this migration is to change the application architecture, not the product design.**

First achieve **1:1 department-side feature and visual parity** in Next.js while locking shared domain identity/state contracts before M06+. Then complete the post-parity Department Pack abstraction so MIDC is implementation #1 rather than the architecture. Then connect real authentication/shared backend services and optimize. PWA capability must remain scoped to `/department/` and enhance installability **without creating stale, unsafe, misleading, or cross-application workflow behavior**.
